description:
pkg/sandbox/overlay.go Cleanup() only unmounts if o.mounted is true:

```go
func (o *Overlay) Cleanup() error {
    if o.mounted {  // <- Bug: skips unmount if flag is false
        if err := o.Unmount(); err != nil {
            return err
        }
    }
    return os.RemoveAll(baseDir)  // Fails if FUSE still mounted!
}
```

Fix:
1. Always try to unmount, regardless of o.mounted flag
2. Use defensive unmounting: fusermount -u, then umount -l, then umount --lazy
3. Only RemoveAll() after confirmed unmount
4. Check mount status with findmnt before cleanup
